/E (The most important design choice is the personal workflow. A student begins with a profile that shows completed courses, required courses for the major, and classes already in progress. From there, the student moves to the dashboard, searches the next semester's classes, builds a plan, and then registers. After registration, the selected classes automatically appear in the schedule and calendar views.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [13]
>>
